# Infra — generated state and anything carrying a real secret.
# The task definitions are GENERATED by provision-new-account.sh and carry a
# live DATABASE_URL (with password) from the moment they're written, plus real
# API keys once filled in. Only the scripts that generate them are committed.
infra/.new-account-env
infra/.db-password-*
infra/.taskdef-*
infra/taskdef-api.json
infra/taskdef-web.json
infra/.cloudfront-config.json
